# Web confirms and alerts

Do **not** use `window.confirm`, `window.alert`, or `window.prompt` in the web app.

## Use instead

```ts
import { useAppDialog } from "@/components/ui/app-dialog";

const { confirm, alert } = useAppDialog();

const ok = await confirm({
  title: "Void this invoice?",
  description: "It will hide from the active list.",
  confirmLabel: "Void",
  destructive: true,
});
if (!ok) return;
```

- Destructive actions: set `destructive: true` (and a clear `confirmLabel`).
- Admin cascade deletes: `AdminCascadeDeleteDialog`, not a bare confirm.
- E2E: drive the in-app dialog via helpers in `apps/web/e2e/helpers/auth.ts`.
